## Third-party attributions

This package renders map tiles and geographic data from third-party services.
Those services are not covered by the MIT license above:

  * Map data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the Open Database
    License (ODbL): https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/
  * Tiles may be served by the OpenStreetMap Foundation, the German OSM
    mirror, or CARTO, each under its own usage policy. See README.md,
    section "Tile sources".
  * Leaflet is a peer dependency and is never bundled. It is BSD-2-Clause.

The OpenStreetMap attribution rendered in the bottom-left corner of every map
is required by the tile providers' usage policies and must not be removed.